/* FRDM-MCXN236 USB overlay for ADB bring-up.
 *
 * The FRDM-MCXN236 board DTS already defines zephyr_udc0 as an alias for
 * usb1 (the HS-capable EHCI controller). No child nodes are needed since
 * the ADB class uses USBD_DEFINE_CLASS (not DT-based instantiation).
 *
 * This file is intentionally minimal — the ADB class instance is registered
 * programmatically via usbd_register_class(), not via DTS.
 */

/* Nothing to add: zephyr_udc0 is already defined in the board DTS. */
